cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use NepSent-Engine, its data engineering pipeline, or its annotation methodology in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "NepSent-Engine: A Methodologically Rigorous Nepali Sentiment Analysis Research Platform"
abstract: "NepSent-Engine is an open-source, scientifically grounded NLP research platform for low-resource Nepali sentiment analysis, providing leakage-free dataset splitting, ordinal agreement analysis, non-parametric bootstrap confidence intervals, and morphological error diagnosis."
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-03
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/koiralapariksit/NepSent-Engine"
authors:
